# Local-only overlay: bake a server URL into a sideload or simulator build.
#
# The store build ships an EMPTY ServerUrl on purpose. A default used to be
# baked in -- one developer's personal ngrok tunnel -- and every store install
# skipped the setup screen and failed to pair against it. See the comment in
# resources/settings/properties.xml.
#
# Sideloaded apps get no settings screen, so development still needs a way to
# put a URL on the device. That is what this overlay is for, and resources-dev
# is gitignored so the URL never reaches a commit or a store package.
#
# Setup, once:
#   cp resources-dev/settings/properties.xml.example resources-dev/settings/properties.xml
#   # then edit it to your own tunnel URL
#
# Usage:
#   monkeyc -f "monkey.jungle;monkey-dev.jungle" -o bin\TrainBud-dev.prg \
#           -y developer_key.der -d fr55 -w
#   .\build.ps1 -Device fr55 -Dev
#
# Never build the store package with this overlay.
base.resourcePath = $(base.resourcePath);resources-dev
